s/3760bf00df9762c81a384536a75d919a.poster.avif?t=1726319069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2239820/extras/3760bf00df9762c81a384536a75d919a.webm?t=1726319069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2239820/extras/3760bf00df9762c81a384536a75d919a.mp4?t=1726319069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Mysterious thriller with a gripping plot.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A large atmospheric town with explorable buildings.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Alluring graphics and detailed locations.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Varied monsters that react to you based on sight and sound.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple viable approaches to combat: fight directly or take a stealthy approach.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Numerous mysteries and conundrums to solve.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An ancient evil has descended upon the rural town of Rabbit Hole. Now Shaun Turner not only has to untangle a twisted web of supernatural events and mysteries to save his family but also escape from the hellish remains of his hometown.",
